  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Local Economic Development through labour-intensive infrastruture development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia has complex multi-sectorial and inter-connected challenges of human insecurities particularly food, social, and economic issues for the most vulnerable and neglected populations of the North-Central region of Liberia at the community level. It is imperative that these dire and interconnected challenges are addressed to prevent vulnerable youth and women from relapsing or resorting to agitations and restiveness.
The strategy focuses on establishing digitally smart villages for improved access to critical SDGs related social services (agriculture, finance, markets, employment, education, health, income security programme, and security), improving access to employment opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
